              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bobbie McGowan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband is very particular and I was so happy when he really loved this recipe. First I made it exactly as it is, then later I made it again but changed the whip cream to Cool Whip. He didn't like it anymore after that. So I will stick to this original recipe from now on.",
